// with its only import, `import { appendFileSync } from 'fs';` (line 6). Introduced by 3478ddcbd (2025-11-02),
// the Phase 41F-L paper-trading test directives. It appended every trade_* / health_engine broadcast to
// diagnostic-reports/phase-41F-L-trace.ndjson, forever, swallowing failures; no reader exists (census D).
